,{"tag":"a","children":["Comlinks"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Comlinks"}," within the interior. Best of all, since the Decoy Glow Rod is functional, Imperial customs agents almost never suspect that such a device is being used to carry contraband. Hiding an item inside a Decoy Glow Rod grants the user a +10 ",{"tag":"a","children":["Equipment"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Equipment","referenceId":"reference:7f2465ac7cefab27"}," bonus on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Stealth"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Stealth","referenceId":"reference:526a40a447ddd7aa"}," checks to hide the item.\n"]},"\n","\n","\n","\n\n","\n\n","\n"]}}
